{"url":"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/","title":"Online Appointment Scheduling with Google Calendar | Google Workspace","description":"If you add an event to any of your calendars, your booking page will automatically update to prevent double-bookings. Learn more · <strong>Open Google Calendar on desktop.</strong> At the top left, click Create &gt; Appointment schedule.","extra_snippets":["Your booking page reflects your real-time availability and syncs with all your calendars. If you add an event to any of your calendars, your booking page will automatically update to prevent double-bookings. Learn more · Open Google Calendar on desktop. At the top left, click Create > Appointment schedule.","Enter a title, set your appointment duration, and set the date and time of your appointments. Optionally, you can add custom questions to your booking form, set a meeting location, and more. After you edit your appointment schedule, click Save.","Learn more by following this step by step guide on how to set up an appointment schedule. When you create a booking page, you can embed a link on your website or share the link directly with others.","Learn how to share your appointment schedule. You get booking confirmation and update emails."]}
{"url":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/business/scheduling-and-booking-app","title":"Online Bookings and Appointment Scheduling | Microsoft 365","description":"Customize appointment details and booking requirements, and specify service providers to streamline the experience for you and your customers. Bookings works seamlessly with your Microsoft 365 calendar to help your customers quickly find available times and avoid double-booking.","extra_snippets":["Customize appointment details and booking requirements, and specify service providers to streamline the experience for you and your customers. Bookings works seamlessly with your Microsoft 365 calendar to help your customers quickly find available times and avoid double-booking.","Get flexibility and customization options to fit a variety of scheduling needs across departments, individuals, and types of appointments. Create and manage multiple Bookings calendars—each with their own unique setup.","Different calendars can have different page structures, information, staff, and types of appointments and communication. Give your customers more options when they visit your booking page, schedule an appointment, or get a confirmation email and calendar invitation.","Customers who book an appointment online can easily reschedule or cancel it themselves to keep everyone in sync. If you prefer to book appointments for your customers, enter the appointment details in Bookings so they receive confirmations and reminders."]}
{"url":"https://www.uwmedicine.org/patient-resources/make-an-appointment","title":"Book a Doctor's Appointment with UW Medicine","description":"If you don&#x27;t have a MyChart account, book as a guest. Learn more about MyChart . ... Manage your care through our secure online patient portal known as MyChart. ... <strong>Monday-Friday, 7:30 am to 5:30 pm</strong>.","extra_snippets":["As a guest, book primary care and OB/GYN appointments. Do you have a MyChart (patient) account that you would like to use to schedule? Note: In MyChart you can book with your doctor or a new doctor. If you don't have a MyChart account, book as a guest. Learn more about MyChart . ... Manage your care through our secure online patient portal known as MyChart. ... Monday-Friday, 7:30 am to 5:30 pm.","With a MyChart account, book with your current healthcare providers and make primary care, telemedicine and OB/GYN appointments.","An interpreter can help you connect with UW Medicine to make an appointment, ask questions about billing, and contact our medical centers. Call to speak with an interpreter.","Book or change an in-person or telemedicine visit."]}
{"url":"https://simplybook.me/en/","title":"SimplyBook.me - Free Appointment Booking System","description":"Online booking system. Booking website or widget for your own website. Let clients schedule appointments, get reminders and pay online 24/7. Free version!","extra_snippets":["Your built-in AI assistant. Set up in minutes, then manage your services, schedule and bookings — all by chat, no tech skills. ... Handle appointments, reminders, payments — all in one AI-powered scheduling system that's easy to set up yourself in minutes","Also, accept bookings directly via Facebook, Instagram, Google or your own branded client app. Automated reminders & updates via WhatsApp, SMS & email · Send automated reminders and updates to staff and clients whenever appointments are booked, canceled, or rescheduled.","Allow clients to book anytime, anywhere. Clients can schedule appointments via the web through multiple channels; your booking website, your own website, client app, Booking.page, Facebook page or Instagram profile.","Email, SMS & Telegram reminders, & automatic booking confirmation notifications help your clients show up on time. ... The system automatically sends feedback requests after appointments so that clients can post their own reviews."]}

